---
// Hero — terminal boot. Real data only: every line mirrors actual repos/status.
// JS types lines char-by-char; no-JS and reduced-motion show everything instantly.
---

<section class="hero" id="top" aria-label="Introduction">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="hero-title" data-reveal>
      NABIEL<span class="accent">_</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" data-reveal>
      Independent AI Developer<span class="sep">·</span>
      Automation Engineer<span class="sep">·</span>
      Technology Builder
    </p>

    <div class="terminal" data-reveal>
      <div class="terminal-bar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
        <span class="terminal-title">~/nabiel — ship log</span>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-body" data-terminal>
        <span class="t-line" data-line>
          <span class="t-prompt">$</span><span class="t-cmd">whoami</span>
        </span>
        <span class="t-line t-out" data-line>
          nabiel — builds <span class="hl">real, working systems</span> with AI and automation
        </span>
        <span class="t-line" data-line>
          <span class="t-prompt">$</span><span class="t-cmd">ls ~/projects</span>
        </span>
        <span class="t-line t-out" data-line>
          <span class="hl">quality-house-v4</span>  freellmapi  smt-lab  mimo-vscode  memo-smt-ea  fable5-pipeline
        </span>
        <span class="t-line" data-line>
          <span class="t-prompt">$</span><span class="t-cmd">ship --status</span>
        </span>
        <span class="t-line t-out" data-line>
          <span class="hl">2 active</span> · 3 research · 2 experimental · 1 sandbox · 0 abandoned
        </span>
        <span class="t-line" data-line>
          <span class="t-prompt">$</span><span class="t-cmd">cat focus.txt</span>
        </span>
        <span class="t-line t-out" data-line>
          "ship real things, document honestly, leak nothing."
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
